<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13418"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lostdog<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lostdog<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, May 04, 2005 - 2:47 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->When Black Friday comes <BR>I&#39;ll collect everything I&#39;m owed <BR>And before my friends find out <BR>I&#39;ll be on the road <BR>When Black Friday falls you know it&#39;s got to be <BR>Don&#39;t let it fall on me <BR> <BR> <BR>SteelyDog <BR> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
