<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13450"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, May 05, 2005 - 12:07 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Body - we have another thread on here where we all were trying to associate some of demon @&#42;&#42;&#39;s rambling&#39;s with Jethro Tull and others. &#40;Because Ian Anderson was in BTK&#39;s puzzle&#41; You seem to have a nack for this, could you check it out?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
